{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is the free demo of Drill Bird<strong>\u00a0 - A cozy-yet-tense digging platformer where every trip underground counts. This demo will give you a slice of the game, but it shall be a good impression of what the game is about. You play as a Bird, fallen from the sky, working to hatch your egg. With a drill for your beak you dig deep for precious ores, and bring them back to to empower your Egg and upgrade your abilities. Outsmart monsters, upgrade your drill, and don\u2019t let night catch you too far from home.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DIG DEEP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore underground caves, mine valuable ores, and uncover hidden treasure. Every block you break or not will bring you closer to helping your egg hatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837840/extras/drillbird-cropped-launchtrailer-ezgif.com-crop?t=1751554621\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEED AND GROW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect ores and feed your egg to grow stronger. The deeper you dig, the bigger opportunities - but every choice matters and will bring risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837840/extras/feed-drillbirdlaunchtrailer-ezgif.com-crop?t=1751554621\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837840/extras/b4573d37873da585d679188195a7c17f.poster.webp?t=1751554621\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837840/extras/b4573d37873da585d679188195a7c17f.webp?t=1751554621\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>OUTSMART MONSTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dangerous creatures lurk in the dark. Drill, dodge, and outmaneuver them to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837840/extras/outsmart-cropped-drillbirdlaunchtrailer-ezgif.com-crop?t=1751554621\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GET HOME BEFORE NIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is always ticking. Make it back before darkness falls\u2026 or face what comes for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837840/extras/survive-cropped-drillbirdlaunchtrailer-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter?t=1751554621\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0<strong>FEATURES\u00a0\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 A cozy-yet-tense platformer with tight design and satisfying digging <br>\u2705 Upgrade your drill, carry strength, health, and more <br>\u2705 Outsmart monsters and solve problems in underground encounters <br>\u2705 Feed and protect your egg - your future depends on it<br>\u2705 Simple, atmospheric story told without words<br>\u2705 A short, satisfying game loop of survival and care</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837840?t=1751554621","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837840?t=1751554621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837840/cdfa36774c512563c5e3c70a1fc6be95eeb786b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751554621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837840/cdfa36774c512563c5e3c70a1fc6be95eeb786b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751554621","categori